      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2st",
          "text": "Truck accidents across Colorado",
          "marks": [
            "l2ss"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2su",
          "text": " often leave people dealing with more than vehicle damage. Medical treatment begins quickly, income becomes uncertain, and insurance companies often reach out before injured people have time to understand their rights or focus on recovery.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b2t5",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l2sx",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/"
        },
        {
          "_key": "l2t0",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/what-to-do-immediately-after-a-truck-accident/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2sw",
          "text": "At ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2sy",
          "text": "Dormer Harpring",
          "marks": [
            "l2sx",
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2sz",
          "text": ", we hear one question more than almost any other ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2t1",
          "text": "after a serious truck crash",
          "marks": [
            "l2t0"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2t2",
          "text": ": “",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2t3",
          "text": "What are damages in truck accident cases?”",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2t4",
          "text": " Gaining clarity early helps injured Coloradans protect themselves while building a claim that reflects the full scope of harm caused by a truck accident.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b2t7",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2t6",
          "text": "Damages refer to the financial and personal losses tied to a truck crash and often determine the true value of a truck accident claim. Colorado law allows injured people to pursue compensation for immediate and long-term consequences that shape how a claim moves forward and whether recovery remains financially possible.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b2t9",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2t8",
          "text": "Economic Damages",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b2tb",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2ta",
          "text": "Economic damages cover the measurable financial losses tied directly to a truck accident. These losses often form the foundation of a claim because documentation and expert analysis help establish value with clarity and credibility.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b2td",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2tc",
          "text": "In Colorado truck accident cases, economic damages often include:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b2tf",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2te",
          "text": "Medical expenses such as emergency care, hospitalization, surgeries, rehabilitation, and future treatment",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b2th",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2tg",
          "text": "Lost income during recovery, along with reduced earning capacity when injuries limit future employment",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b2tj",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2ti",
          "text": "Property damage involving vehicles and personal belongings",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b2tl",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2tk",
          "text": "Out-of-pocket costs related to mobility limitations, home assistance, or necessary modifications",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b2tn",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2tm",
          "text": "When injured people begin asking what damages apply in truck accident cases, economic losses usually surface first because they show how a crash disrupted financial stability. Serious truck accidents frequently require extended medical care, especially when injuries affect the spine, brain, or mobility. Early documentation often makes a measurable difference, since medical records, employment history, and expert analysis shape how insurers evaluate these damages.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b2tp",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2to",
          "text": "Our team works with medical professionals, vocational experts, and financial specialists to present a forward-looking picture of how a truck accident continues to affect income, expenses, and career opportunities long after the initial recovery phase.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "image",
      "_key": "i2tq",
      "src": "./images/2026-03-what-are-damages-in-truck-accident-cases.jpg",
      "alt": "what are damages in truck accident cases"
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b2ts",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2tr",
          "text": "Non-Economic Damages",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b2tu",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2tt",
          "text": "Non-economic damages focus on the personal harm a truck accident causes, losses that do not appear on bills or pay stubs but affect daily life in lasting ways. Colorado law recognizes these harms and allows injured people to seek compensation for the emotional and physical impact of serious injuries.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b2u1",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l2tw",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://colorado.public.law/statutes/crs_13-21-102.5"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2tv",
          "text": "Under ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2tx",
          "text": "Colorado Revised Statutes section 13-21-102.5",
          "marks": [
            "strong",
            "l2tw"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2ty",
          "text": ", a noneconomic loss or injury means nonpecuniary harm recoverable by the person suffering the direct or primary injury, including pain and suffering, inconvenience, emotional stress, and impairment of quality of life. ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2tz",
          "text": "In real-world truck accident cases",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2u0",
          "text": ", these harms often involve chronic pain, anxiety, sleep disruption, and changes in independence or personal relationships.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b2u5",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2u2",
          "text": "For families trying to understand ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2u3",
          "text": "“What are damages in truck accident cases?”",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2u4",
          "text": ", non-economic damages often feel deeply personal because they capture how everyday life changes after a serious crash. Separate provisions of Colorado law place limits on certain non-economic damages in personal injury cases, which makes clear documentation and persuasive explanation especially important when presenting these losses.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b2u7",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2u6",
          "text": "Punitive Damages",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b2ue",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l2u8",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.law.cornell.edu/wex/punitive_damages"
        },
        {
          "_key": "l2ub",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/contributory-negligence-vs-comparative-negligence/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2u9",
          "text": "Punitive damages",
          "marks": [
            "strong",
            "l2u8"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2ua",
          "text": " serve a different purpose than other forms of compensation. Rather than focusing on an injured person’s losses, punitive damages aim to punish especially reckless or harmful conduct and discourage similar behavior. Punitive damages may apply when evidence shows intentional misconduct, fraud, or willful and wanton conduct ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2uc",
          "text": "beyond ordinary negligence",
          "marks": [
            "l2ub"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2ud",
          "text": ".",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b2ug",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2uf",
          "text": "In the context of Colorado truck accident cases, these damages may arise when trucking companies ignore safety rules, pressure drivers to exceed legal limits, or allow unsafe vehicles to remain on the road. Courts apply a high standard when reviewing punitive damage claims, and additional proof beyond ordinary negligence is typically required. Although punitive damages appear less frequently, they play an important role when corporate decisions place public safety at risk.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b2ui",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2uh",
          "text": "Who Can Be Held Liable for a Truck Accident?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b2uk",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2uj",
          "text": "Truck accidents involving commercial vehicles often involve multiple responsible parties, which separates these cases from typical car crashes. Liability may extend beyond the truck driver to several entities involved in commercial transportation, including:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b2um",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2ul",
          "text": "The truck driver",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b2uo",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2un",
          "text": "The trucking company or employer",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b2uq",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2up",
          "text": "Maintenance or repair contractors",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b2us",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2ur",
          "text": "Cargo loading companies",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b2uu",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2ut",
          "text": "Manufacturers of defective truck components",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b2uw",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2uv",
          "text": "Colorado’s commercial trucking industry operates under strict safety expectations, and identifying every responsible party strengthens a claim. Trucking companies may face liability for negligent hiring, unsafe scheduling, or inadequate training, while third parties may contribute through faulty equipment or improper loading.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b2uy",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2ux",
          "text": "Because commercial trucking involves layered regulation and insurance coverage, a thorough investigation often makes a meaningful difference when accountability determines the value of damages.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b2v0",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
